{"unit_id":"xian-yu-zhao__dsh-message-manager#card-zh","repo":"xian-yu-zhao/dsh-message-manager","commit":"5faf2d1573c7cc0395a54563880df51a7ba96507","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Session Message Manager 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话消息管理插件。在会话标题栏打开管理面板，查看当前模型上下文中的消息并批量选择删除或恢复；也可通过 /msgmgr 命令或 message_manager 工具列出和处理消息。删除会从后续模型请求的上下文中移除选中消息，相关工具调用结果会成组处理，原始会话日志与聊天记录仍保留。用户消息和普通上下文可恢复到原位置，助手消息或工具组恢复到末尾；部分操作会在下一次请求前应用。适合需要精细整理单个会话上下文的 DSH Web 用户。需要会话处于运行状态，不需要额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:911-928","index.js:507-596","core.js:200-259"]}
{"unit_id":"xian-yu-zhao__dsh-message-manager#card-en","repo":"xian-yu-zhao/dsh-message-manager","commit":"5faf2d1573c7cc0395a54563880df51a7ba96507","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Session Message Manager lets DSH Web users review, batch-delete, and restore session messages from a header panel or with /msgmgr. Deletion affects later requests while keeping the log and chat transcript. Related tool results are grouped. Requires a live session; no key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:911-928","index.js:507-596","core.js:200-259"]}
