{"unit_id":"xian-yu-zhao__dsh-message-manager#feature-1","repo":"xian-yu-zhao/dsh-message-manager","commit":"5faf2d1573c7cc0395a54563880df51a7ba96507","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Message Manager 的功能「查看当前消息」：打开会话标题栏的管理面板，可查看当前模型上下文中的消息预览和序号，并查看删除记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:477-520","client.js:639-695"]}
{"unit_id":"xian-yu-zhao__dsh-message-manager#feature-2","repo":"xian-yu-zhao/dsh-message-manager","commit":"5faf2d1573c7cc0395a54563880df51a7ba96507","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Message Manager 的功能「批量删除」：在面板勾选一条或多条消息并确认，或使用 /msgmgr delete 序号；选中消息会从后续模型请求上下文移除。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:520-579","index.js:507-532"]}
{"unit_id":"xian-yu-zhao__dsh-message-manager#feature-3","repo":"xian-yu-zhao/dsh-message-manager","commit":"5faf2d1573c7cc0395a54563880df51a7ba96507","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Message Manager 的功能「恢复删除记录」：在面板选择可恢复记录或执行 /msgmgr restore 序号；用户和普通上下文回到原位置，助手内容及工具组追加到末尾。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:163-205","index.js:224-303","client.js:639-695"]}
{"unit_id":"xian-yu-zhao__dsh-message-manager#feature-4","repo":"xian-yu-zhao/dsh-message-manager","commit":"5faf2d1573c7cc0395a54563880df51a7ba96507","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Message Manager 的功能「命令与工具操作」：在当前运行会话中调用 /msgmgr 或 message_manager，可列出消息、按序号删除或恢复；不安全时会排队到下一次请求应用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:507-596","index.js:435-483"]}
{"unit_id":"xian-yu-zhao__dsh-message-manager#caveat-1","repo":"xian-yu-zhao/dsh-message-manager","commit":"5faf2d1573c7cc0395a54563880df51a7ba96507","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Session Message Manager 使用前须知：恢复的助手消息会追加到聊天末尾，工具调用组整组恢复；单独工具结果及部分上下文类型不能恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:173-204","index.js:224-303"]}
